(4859268, 703616, 62027, '<td valign="top">quite abstract! I love abstract, but this cropping doesn''t seem quite intentional. The bottom right corner in response to the bottom left corner seems to compete... but as far as causing dialogue, it makes you wonder what you are trying to tell here. Not what the abstract content is, but... what is the message you are trying to tell with your composition?</td>', 'quite abstract! I love abstract, but this cropping doesn''t seem quite intentional. The bottom right corner in response to the bottom left corner seems to compete... but as far as causing dialogue, it makes you wonder what you are trying to tell here. Not what the abstract content is, but... what is the message you are trying to tell with your composition?', '2008-08-02 13:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859269, 704298, 62027, '<td valign="top">nice selection for a site! this stands out because of it''s unique location. Good shot, good thought. I would like the image more if the bottom portion of the composition were cropped tighter to eliminate that first terrace we see. Overall, it''s a cool photograph, very nice :)</td>', 'nice selection for a site! this stands out because of it''s unique location. Good shot, good thought. I would like the image more if the bottom portion of the composition were cropped tighter to eliminate that first terrace we see. Overall, it''s a cool photograph, very nice :)', '2008-08-02 13:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
