(4860678, 704461, 69368, '<td valign="top">this border is a "no-go", IMO. Kills the image and it''s much too powerful.</td>', 'this border is a "no-go", IMO. Kills the image and it''s much too powerful.', '2008-08-03 04:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4860681, 704001, 69368, '<td valign="top">can''t see any "Lawn" here.....</td>', 'can''t see any "Lawn" here.....', '2008-08-03 05:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4861041, 704404, 75034, '<td valign="top">I think I know this guy. Have we met? That lawn mower looks familiar. That being said, I like the composition of this shot, it''s simple yet it''s able to hold ones interest. It''s nice to see that the medication is working :)~ <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=691232" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/879/120/691232.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/879/120/691232.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/879/120/691232.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>MAX!</td>', 'I think I know this guy. Have we met? That lawn mower looks familiar. That being said, I like the composition of this shot, it''s simple yet it''s able to hold ones interest. It''s nice to see that the medication is working :)~   MAX!', '2008-08-03 10:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4861224, 704136, 79838, '<td valign="top">There is always enough room for female beauty.<br/>I like the combination of brown and blond hair, also the combination of skin color.</td>', 'There is always enough room for female beauty.I like the combination of brown and blond hair, also the combination of skin color.', '2008-08-03 11:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4861226, 704270, 79838, '<td valign="top">Very good composition, but something is missing in the bottom half.</td>', 'Very good composition, but something is missing in the bottom half.', '2008-08-03 11:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4861230, 704081, 79838, '<td valign="top">very original idea, nice composition, very well managed dof.</td>', 'very original idea, nice composition, very well managed dof.', '2008-08-03 11:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4861450, 704184, 47470, '<td valign="top">The color seems a bit oversaturated, but the water drops are very pretty.</td>', 'The color seems a bit oversaturated, but the water drops are very pretty.', '2008-08-03 14:20:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4861557, 703495, 52549, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image, good luck with it.</td>', 'Beautiful image, good luck with it.', '2008-08-03 15:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4861559, 703888, 52549, '<td valign="top">Very good.</td>', 'Very good.', '2008-08-03 15:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4861562, 703189, 52549, '<td valign="top">Fantastic, best one yet!</td>', 'Fantastic, best one yet!', '2008-08-03 15:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4861583, 704049, 47470, '<td valign="top">The water is sparkling as if the sun is out, but there are no shadows.  I think this would be better if you had left the shadows in.</td>', 'The water is sparkling as if the sun is out, but there are no shadows.  I think this would be better if you had left the shadows in.', '2008-08-03 16:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4861586, 704036, 47470, '<td valign="top">The sky is very pretty, but the lawn doesn''t seem to be a main subject.</td>', 'The sky is very pretty, but the lawn doesn''t seem to be a main subject.', '2008-08-03 16:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4861597, 704136, 47470, '<td valign="top">Um, underwear shot?<br/> <br/>I would have moved everything a bit so the background would have been just grass, without the fence and little black lamp.  The handbag could have been placed by their feet so we could see it better.</td>', 'Um, underwear shot? I would have moved everything a bit so the background would have been just grass, without the fence and little black lamp.  The handbag could have been placed by their feet so we could see it better.', '2008-08-03 16:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4861601, 704404, 47470, '<td valign="top">The composition and sun burst are very nice, but the picture seems to have been overly compressed so that the colors don''t transition from one shade to another very smoothly ("Save for Web" may be the culprit here?).</td>', 'The composition and sun burst are very nice, but the picture seems to have been overly compressed so that the colors don''t transition from one shade to another very smoothly ("Save for Web" may be the culprit here?).', '2008-08-03 16:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4861604, 703909, 47470, '<td valign="top">I think a little boost in contrast would make the snails stand out some more and give the overall photo some oomph.</td>', 'I think a little boost in contrast would make the snails stand out some more and give the overall photo some oomph.', '2008-08-03 16:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4861905, 703477, 1031, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of a joke I just got in an email:<br/> <br/>Two guys are stopped at a traffic light when a truck loaded with fresh sod stops beside them.<br/>"Gee," one says, "I wish I could afford to send my lawn out to be cut."</td>', 'This reminds me of a joke I just got in an email: Two guys are stopped at a traffic light when a truck loaded with fresh sod stops beside them."Gee," one says, "I wish I could afford to send my lawn out to be cut."', '2008-08-03 18:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4861926, 702590, 1031, '<td valign="top">The in-focus branches at the top seem to create a false sense of the depth -- they seem nearer than the in-focus middle of the path.<br/> <br/>I wonder how this would look if the nearest foreground was in focus with a constant blurring to the rear, rather than having the in-focus area part-way back.</td>', 'The in-focus branches at the top seem to create a false sense of the depth -- they seem nearer than the in-focus middle of the path. I wonder how this would look if the nearest foreground was in focus with a constant blurring to the rear, rather than having the in-focus area part-way back.', '2008-08-03 18:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4861936, 704461, 1031, '<td valign="top">The subtle border contributes significantly to the overall effect. ;-)</td>', 'The subtle border contributes significantly to the overall effect. ;-)', '2008-08-03 18:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4861987, 704298, 1031, '<td valign="top">Great choice of subject -- I like the strongly contrasting parallel lines.</td>', 'Great choice of subject -- I like the strongly contrasting parallel lines.', '2008-08-03 19:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4862002, 704137, 1031, '<td valign="top">Hmmm ... I think I know how I''d do this -- I''m curious to see how you did.</td>', 'Hmmm ... I think I know how I''d do this -- I''m curious to see how you did.', '2008-08-03 19:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4862033, 703328, 1031, '<td valign="top">Can you just cut a little trough leading to the hole? ;-)</td>', 'Can you just cut a little trough leading to the hole? ;-)', '2008-08-03 19:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4862037, 703945, 1031, '<td valign="top">I can almost smell the breeze -- effectively evocative picture of a familiar place from the past.</td>', 'I can almost smell the breeze -- effectively evocative picture of a familiar place from the past.', '2008-08-03 19:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4862156, 703274, 60321, '<td valign="top">lovely shot here. makes me thing of alice in wonderland</td>', 'lovely shot here. makes me thing of alice in wonderland', '2008-08-03 21:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4862157, 704362, 60321, '<td valign="top">haha love the title and wonderful composition and colors.</td>', 'haha love the title and wonderful composition and colors.', '2008-08-03 21:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4862171, 704089, 60321, '<td valign="top">a little out of focus but great color and comp</td>', 'a little out of focus but great color and comp', '2008-08-03 21:18:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4862298, 703790, 79357, '<td valign="top">technically not really perfect, but still that perfect moment.</td>', 'technically not really perfect, but still that perfect moment.', '2008-08-03 22:03:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4862299, 703833, 79357, '<td valign="top">Beautiful house! A little too much grass</td>', 'Beautiful house! A little too much grass', '2008-08-03 22:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4862302, 704049, 79357, '<td valign="top">Good idea, a little too much Highlights &amp; Shadow effect for my taste. Landscape orientation would be even more powerful.</td>', 'Good idea, a little too much Highlights & Shadow effect for my taste. Landscape orientation would be even more powerful.', '2008-08-03 22:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4862308, 704228, 79357, '<td valign="top">A shame this great shot is not sharper.</td>', 'A shame this great shot is not sharper.', '2008-08-03 22:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4862309, 703825, 79357, '<td valign="top">Fantastic light in her hair! Could you crop it a little tighter?</td>', 'Fantastic light in her hair! Could you crop it a little tighter?', '2008-08-03 22:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4862312, 704136, 79357, '<td valign="top">Great shot! Could you remove those upper right dots and it would be a stunner.</td>', 'Great shot! Could you remove those upper right dots and it would be a stunner.', '2008-08-03 22:07:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4862316, 703951, 79357, '<td valign="top">Crop a little tighter and this would be fantastic!</td>', 'Crop a little tighter and this would be fantastic!', '2008-08-03 22:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4863109, 704081, 97067, '<td valign="top">Nice ideea.. :)</td>', 'Nice ideea.. :)', '2008-08-04 02:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4863191, 703616, 6771, '<td valign="top">As this looks to be an interesting study in abstract, I am not sure of how it relates to Lawn.  FOr people to get it...it has to slap them upside the head.  Soothing colors though</td>', 'As this looks to be an interesting study in abstract, I am not sure of how it relates to Lawn.  FOr people to get it...it has to slap them upside the head.  Soothing colors though', '2008-08-04 04:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4863197, 704062, 6771, '<td valign="top">I like the point of view and there is decent focus, but there are lots of blown highlights form the top down, and it distracts from the rest of the subject</td>', 'I like the point of view and there is decent focus, but there are lots of blown highlights form the top down, and it distracts from the rest of the subject', '2008-08-04 04:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4863198, 703152, 6771, '<td valign="top">the focus is good, but a little more depth to include the eyes.  better composition, ie: non centered and a "something extra" might have helped more.</td>', 'the focus is good, but a little more depth to include the eyes.  better composition, ie: non centered and a "something extra" might have helped more.', '2008-08-04 04:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4863204, 704219, 6771, '<td valign="top">There is a point of focus there in the lawn, but it doesn''t do the picture well.  More DOF to include the dog as a subject would help interest the viewer.  It seems a bit underexposed</td>', 'There is a point of focus there in the lawn, but it doesn''t do the picture well.  More DOF to include the dog as a subject would help interest the viewer.  It seems a bit underexposed', '2008-08-04 04:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4863208, 704360, 6771, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and angle, the DOF almost seems there.  the little flower looks a touch out of focus and with some very bright highlights on it''s top</td>', 'I like the composition and angle, the DOF almost seems there.  the little flower looks a touch out of focus and with some very bright highlights on it''s top', '2008-08-04 04:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4863209, 703185, 6771, '<td valign="top">The piece of concrete dominates the photo and there is not much interest to concrete.  The exposure seems pretty good</td>', 'The piece of concrete dominates the photo and there is not much interest to concrete.  The exposure seems pretty good', '2008-08-04 04:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4863210, 703974, 6771, '<td valign="top">My fave of the challenge....but I love bugs.  Very nice capture, focus, colors, and exposure.  I like the way the light seems to be shining through the spiders abdomen.</td>', 'My fave of the challenge....but I love bugs.  Very nice capture, focus, colors, and exposure.  I like the way the light seems to be shining through the spiders abdomen.', '2008-08-04 04:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4863212, 703495, 6771, '<td valign="top">Very nice abstract photo of grass.  I like the way the in focus blades melt away into the faded out areas.</td>', 'Very nice abstract photo of grass.  I like the way the in focus blades melt away into the faded out areas.', '2008-08-04 04:31:08.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4863214, 704238, 6771, '<td valign="top">The exposure looks good on this, just the DOF and/or focus and/or motion blur is just a little off on the bee.  Of course a faster shutter speed would fix the blur and maybe stop the wings totally, larger aperture for depth.</td>', 'The exposure looks good on this, just the DOF and/or focus and/or motion blur is just a little off on the bee.  Of course a faster shutter speed would fix the blur and maybe stop the wings totally, larger aperture for depth.', '2008-08-04 04:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4863215, 704480, 6771, '<td valign="top">The exposure would be tough on this with bright grass and dark shaded trees.  The interest in the photo doesn''t hold the viewer for long.</td>', 'The exposure would be tough on this with bright grass and dark shaded trees.  The interest in the photo doesn''t hold the viewer for long.', '2008-08-04 04:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4863216, 704341, 6771, '<td valign="top">Good idea, decent exposure.  Focus/DOF seem a little off form this distance and size of photo...hard to tell</td>', 'Good idea, decent exposure.  Focus/DOF seem a little off form this distance and size of photo...hard to tell', '2008-08-04 04:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4863218, 703603, 6771, '<td valign="top">Hope you are digging those out of your lawn.  The bug should be in focus along with both flowers to contain interest.  Larger aperture for deeper DOF</td>', 'Hope you are digging those out of your lawn.  The bug should be in focus along with both flowers to contain interest.  Larger aperture for deeper DOF', '2008-08-04 04:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4863221, 703965, 6771, '<td valign="top">Good subject.  Poor composition.  Centering subects does work for many things, but doesn''t seem to work well here.  Low interest.  The sky is blown out</td>', 'Good subject.  Poor composition.  Centering subects does work for many things, but doesn''t seem to work well here.  Low interest.  The sky is blown out', '2008-08-04 04:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4863223, 703181, 6771, '<td valign="top">I know the challenge is Lawn, but not having the dog in focus is kind of annoying.  It would seem he is the subject.  Good angle</td>', 'I know the challenge is Lawn, but not having the dog in focus is kind of annoying.  It would seem he is the subject.  Good angle', '2008-08-04 04:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4863230, 703646, 6771, '<td valign="top">colors and composition look good.  the blown areas in the background are a bit distracting.  The focus appears "off" at this picture size</td>', 'colors and composition look good.  the blown areas in the background are a bit distracting.  The focus appears "off" at this picture size', '2008-08-04 04:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4863233, 704314, 96462, '<td valign="top">Beautiful primary colours and what a dramatic location!  My only issue would be the way the yellow object in the yard joins with the house, which I find slightly distracting.  Otherwise my favourite for this challenge.  Great!</td>', 'Beautiful primary colours and what a dramatic location!  My only issue would be the way the yellow object in the yard joins with the house, which I find slightly distracting.  Otherwise my favourite for this challenge.  Great!', '2008-08-04 04:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4863329, 704103, 94321, '<td valign="top">nice pic</td>', 'nice pic', '2008-08-04 05:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4863466, 703152, 92864, '<td valign="top">It seems a bit out-of-focus. I guess it would also work better if the figure wasn''t centered.</td>', 'It seems a bit out-of-focus. I guess it would also work better if the figure wasn''t centered.', '2008-08-04 08:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4863494, 704404, 92864, '<td valign="top">It seems a bit noisy and oversaturated to me.</td>', 'It seems a bit noisy and oversaturated to me.', '2008-08-04 09:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
