(4867433, 702534, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the way most of her body is out of the focal plane with just the toes in focus. And I like the way that the foreground and background are all grass. And the vivid colours. But the distortion from the angle makes it seem that she''s all leg with no body or arms!</td>', 'I like the way most of her body is out of the focal plane with just the toes in focus. And I like the way that the foreground and background are all grass. And the vivid colours. But the distortion from the angle makes it seem that she''s all leg with no body or arms!', '2008-08-05 18:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
