(4868571, 703373, 61818, '<td valign="top">No lawn, man.  No lawn, no love.  I think you probably got beat up a bit for not having a typical lawn in the shot.  Didn''t vote in the challenge personally.  I''m saving my votes for more exciting challenge ideas like ''roof'' and ''driveway''.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-08-06 00:41:24.</i></td>', 'No lawn, man.  No lawn, no love.  I think you probably got beat up a bit for not having a typical lawn in the shot.  Didn''t vote in the challenge personally.  I''m saving my votes for more exciting challenge ideas like ''roof'' and ''driveway''.', '2008-08-06 01:40:57.000000', '2008-08-06 01:41:24.000000', 0),
