(4868612, 703373, 92643, '<td valign="top">I do like the outtake colors better actually....i''m glad that me commenting gave you at least one comment during the challenge! sorry if it wasn''t very helpful.  I like that you were more creative and thought outside the box.</td>', 'I do like the outtake colors better actually....i''m glad that me commenting gave you at least one comment during the challenge! sorry if it wasn''t very helpful.  I like that you were more creative and thought outside the box.', '2008-08-06 01:46:52.000000', NULL, 0),
