(4868637, 704314, 52549, '<td valign="top">A lawn by the sea! The sky is exquisite, I love this image. Congrats on winning, Þorsteinn.</td>', 'A lawn by the sea! The sky is exquisite, I love this image. Congrats on winning, Þorsteinn.', '2008-08-06 01:52:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(4868646, 703373, 22301, '<td valign="top">I think we suffered similar fates on our entries into the lawn challenge. I ended at 5.5. We didn''t present the lawn as a standout subject and voters wanted that.  I think the composition could be improved, the horizon below center doesn''t do much for me as the details are all in the foreground, and the sky doesn''t add to the composition that much. I may have cropped just above the big cloud on the right. The colors suit the industrial site well too.<br/>Joe</td>', 'I think we suffered similar fates on our entries into the lawn challenge. I ended at 5.5. We didn''t present the lawn as a standout subject and voters wanted that.  I think the composition could be improved, the horizon below center doesn''t do much for me as the details are all in the foreground, and the sky doesn''t add to the composition that much. I may have cropped just above the big cloud on the right. The colors suit the industrial site well too.Joe', '2008-08-06 01:54:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(4868653, 703373, 54645, '<td valign="top">I think the lines are good, definitely an industrial feel, with a loss of a lawn. So I enjoyed the image for it''s subject and message. The main problem...I don''t know what to look at, as my eye wanders for something in focus. Finally the flash hurt the sign in that the shadow robbed you of DOF.<br/> <br/>Your Disney Concert hall rocks! Love it. <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=685695" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/871/120/685695.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/871/120/685695.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/871/120/685695.jpg"/></a></td>', 'I think the lines are good, definitely an industrial feel, with a loss of a lawn. So I enjoyed the image for it''s subject and message. The main problem...I don''t know what to look at, as my eye wanders for something in focus. Finally the flash hurt the sign in that the shadow robbed you of DOF. Your Disney Concert hall rocks! Love it. ', '2008-08-06 01:54:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(4868656, 703373, 78516, '<td valign="top">It''s kind of a cool looking shot, but I''m sure you were scored lower because the focus isn''t really on the grass. I see the sign and the building. Without knowing that this was a grass challenge I never would have given the dead grass a second thought. I do still think it''s kind of an interesting photo to look at though!</td>', 'It''s kind of a cool looking shot, but I''m sure you were scored lower because the focus isn''t really on the grass. I see the sign and the building. Without knowing that this was a grass challenge I never would have given the dead grass a second thought. I do still think it''s kind of an interesting photo to look at though!', '2008-08-06 01:55:30.000000', NULL, 0),
