(4872357, 704103, 67343, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your ribbon, very well done. :)</td>', 'Congratulations on your ribbon, very well done. :)', '2008-08-07 10:25:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(4872415, 703839, 24454, '<td valign="top">Shelley, I''m so jealous.  First, that you LIVE in a place so beautiful!   And second, you captured such beauty in Texas!    That is such a challenge for me, and is why I have gravitated to people, animals, macros. . .anything but scenery.  But you have inspired me!<br/> <br/>The only thing I don''t love about this photo is the score it ended up with!  It deserved so much more.   At least your commenters came closer to what it deserves, right?<br/> <br/>Next time we have a get-together, I hope you can come.   Jutilda and I get together pretty regularly, so it would be fun to meet you in person.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Shelley, I''m so jealous.  First, that you LIVE in a place so beautiful!   And second, you captured such beauty in Texas!    That is such a challenge for me, and is why I have gravitated to people, animals, macros. . .anything but scenery.  But you have inspired me! The only thing I don''t love about this photo is the score it ended up with!  It deserved so much more.   At least your commenters came closer to what it deserves, right? Next time we have a get-together, I hope you can come.   Jutilda and I get together pretty regularly, so it would be fun to meet you in person. ', '2008-08-07 10:52:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(4872614, 704103, 72579, '<td valign="top">The golf ball looks a little flat.And some of the grass is out of focus, but nice job otherwise. Congrats on the ribbon you deserve it! :)</td>', 'The golf ball looks a little flat.And some of the grass is out of focus, but nice job otherwise. Congrats on the ribbon you deserve it! :)', '2008-08-07 12:44:03.000000', NULL, 0),
