(4880509, 704032, 33672, '<td valign="top">I think the lack of contrast between the catipillar and the flower took away points from an otherwise well composed and taken photo!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-08-11 11:40:31.</i></td>', 'I think the lack of contrast between the catipillar and the flower took away points from an otherwise well composed and taken photo!', '2008-08-11 12:39:36.000000', '2008-08-11 12:40:31.000000', 0),
(4880715, 703537, 96751, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for your comments.  I chose to add this photo to the Lawn category because in my mind, if there had been a house on this lot, this would have been the front lawn.<br/> <br/>@Blackbox - it''s in Los Angeles, CA.<br/>@if-images - I agree.  <br/>@dirtdiver - I don''t know why I didn''t circled it to look for another perspective.  This one just stopped me in my tracks.  But I''m a newbie, and I''m sure experience will help :-)</td>', 'Thank you all for your comments.  I chose to add this photo to the Lawn category because in my mind, if there had been a house on this lot, this would have been the front lawn. @Blackbox - it''s in Los Angeles, CA.@if-images - I agree.  @dirtdiver - I don''t know why I didn''t circled it to look for another perspective.  This one just stopped me in my tracks.  But I''m a newbie, and I''m sure experience will help :-)', '2008-08-11 14:35:32.000000', NULL, 0),
