(4885432, 702490, 66384, '<td valign="top">I like the DOF, focus, and colors. I think I would like it even better if it were rotated CC so the pot is straight. That would give a little more of an upward/diagonal line to the grass.</td>', 'I like the DOF, focus, and colors. I think I would like it even better if it were rotated CC so the pot is straight. That would give a little more of an upward/diagonal line to the grass.', '2008-08-13 10:55:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(4887697, 703477, 39427, '<td valign="top">this is a great idea (and the kind of thing that scores well on this site) and the composition is solid but you gotta work on your editing skills to bring ideas like this to the next level.  You''ll get a lot of low scores for for the flatness of the image - there are too many gray pixels that muddy the appearance.  This can be remedied with some curves or levels work in photoshop, setting your ''black point'', etc... Good luck, you seem to have some really novel ideas, hope you can continue to grow in your execution of them.</td>', 'this is a great idea (and the kind of thing that scores well on this site) and the composition is solid but you gotta work on your editing skills to bring ideas like this to the next level.  You''ll get a lot of low scores for for the flatness of the image - there are too many gray pixels that muddy the appearance.  This can be remedied with some curves or levels work in photoshop, setting your ''black point'', etc... Good luck, you seem to have some really novel ideas, hope you can continue to grow in your execution of them.', '2008-08-14 01:00:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(4897636, 704106, 30982, '<td valign="top">The grass IS a nice contrasting element.  Voters wanted it to be THE element, though.  I like how the lens and angle combination give her impossibly long legs from ankle to knee.  Love the bold black sky, too.</td>', 'The grass IS a nice contrasting element.  Voters wanted it to be THE element, though.  I like how the lens and angle combination give her impossibly long legs from ankle to knee.  Love the bold black sky, too.', '2008-08-19 16:47:45.000000', NULL, 0),
